# .antigravityrules

**For Antigravity (Gemini) and similar agents:** Primary guidance is [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md). Read it first. This file is a short, current-rules companion — not a changelog. Mirror: [.cursorrules](./.cursorrules). Also: [CLAUDE.md](./CLAUDE.md), [GROK.md](./GROK.md), [CURSOR.md](./CURSOR.md).

- Role: Senior Software Architect & Expert Game Developer
- Stack: TypeScript (strict, zero `any`), React 19, HTML5 Canvas 2D
- Styling: monospace retro; `App.css` / `index.css` (no UI kit, no Tailwind)
- Language: reply in French (Québécois preferred), even if the user writes in English

## Core Principles

1. Never mix React state with the Canvas high-frequency loop. React owns `GamePhase`, players, money, shop, HUD. GameEngine owns physics, terrain, projectiles, drawing, combat audio.
2. Modular, strongly-typed TypeScript. Shared types go in `src/types/`.
3. Physics at fixed 120 Hz, decoupled from display raf.
4. RNG: `secureRandom` from `src/utils/random.ts` — never `Math.random`.

## Game Specs (current)

- Loop: `requestAnimationFrame` + `PHYSICS_DT = 1/120` in `GameEngine`.
- Terrain: custom heightmap in `Terrain.ts` (multi-octaves, bumps/creux). Materials (`src/types/terrain.ts`): `DIRT` (normal), `ROCK` (indestructible stone wall for side blast; exploding on top: +50% blast, radius unaffected), `SOFT` (2.5x destruction). DRILLER: oriented shaft (`destroyTerrainShaft`, `DRILLER_SHAFT_DEPTH` = 53). GRENADE: ~2× bounce on ROCK; first contact on SOFT sticks and detonates (`grenadeBounceParams`).
- Spawns: shuffled X biased toward hollows, 100 px gap, 13 % margins, `Y = groundY`. Local humans: −25 % on SOFT. AI all modes: −25 % on ROCK (`spawnAcceptsMaterial`).
- Players: 2–4, any mix Human / `v1-random` (IA SIMPLE) / `v2-heuristic` (IA OK) / `v3-sniper` (IA SNIPER) / `v4-smart` (IA EXPERT).
- Palette: `VGA_PALETTE` only (16 VGA + neon arcade extras).
- Tanks: `drawTankSprite` only, 24×15, slope tilt, independent turret. Active triangle, `ownerColor` shells, micro recoil.
- Phases: `MENU` → `COMBAT` → `RESOLUTION` → `CELEBRATION` → `SUMMARY` → `SHOP` → `GAME_OVER`.
- Shields & Gauges: 40 innate shield points per tank/round. Direct hits deal 2× damage to shield (absorbs via `Math.ceil(shield / 2)`; 1× overflow to health); indirect splash deals 1× damage. Fall damage directly reduces health, leaving shield intact. Visual gauge on Canvas: single dark cyan bar at $y-24$ when shield > 0 and health is full; stacked dual bars (dark cyan shield at $y-28$, green health at $y-23$, name at $y-36$) when shield > 0 and health < maxHealth; single green bar at $y-24$ when shield <= 0.
- Weapons: `WEAPON_REGISTRY` in `src/types/weapon.ts`. Missile unlimited, not in shop. Economy: $300 destroy / $600 last standing / $500 survival.
- Pricing: Baby Nuke (`NUKE`) costs $420; BULLDOZER $150 (0 HP / 0 blast, push + recoil, skips `applyExplosionDamage`). All shop and AI purchases derive from `WEAPON_REGISTRY`.
- Online (in `main`): `worker/` + `OnlineLobby.tsx` + `useGameSession.ts` + `onlineSession.ts`. Shared turn helper: `src/game/online/turnOrder.ts`. `GAME_START` sends `materials` only when the server array matches `heights`; `loadHeights` falls back to `DIRT`. Dev: `npm run dev` + `npm run worker:dev`. `worker/.wrangler/` gitignored.
- Tests: **430** across **52** files. Version `0.6.0`.

## AI

All tank AI implements `AIEngine`. Router: `AIByProfileStrategy` in `GameCanvas.tsx`.

- `v1-random` / `AISimpleStrategy` — naive. Do not add `fallibleAim`. Early rounds alcoholic (`roundSkill`).
- `v2-heuristic` / `AIHeuristicStrategy` — first shot ≥ 36 px, lock at shot 5 (`SHOTS_TO_HIT`).
- `v3-sniper` / `AISniperStrategy` — first shot ≥ 36 px, lock at shot 4, 14 % slip after lock.
- `v4-smart` / `AISmartStrategy` — first shot ≥ 36 px, lock at shot 3.

v2–v4 share `fallibleAim.ts` + `roundSkill.ts` (ease-out warmup, late tighten), `terrainMaterialTactics.ts` (no DRILLER on ROCK; prefer DRILLER on SOFT when the default is MISSILE), and `bulldozerTactics.ts` (BULLDOZER on map edge / drop ≥ 12 px; v1 never buys or fires it). All AI share `hitReaction.ts` (Issue 174: direct hit +50%, fall 1–25% cumulative on shot 1; shot 2: Sniper 0%, Expert 12%, OK/Simple 25%; shot 3: 0%). New profile → new file under `game/entities/ai/`, register in the dispatcher. Never put AI in `TankManager` or `GameEngine`.

